id: pm-gh1089
title: "GH-1089: expose reproducible execution through supported CLI and MCP process configuration"
description: "The published SDK can install a deterministic clock and seeded entropy, but process consumers invoking pm or pm-mcp cannot enter that context. Add one typed public SDK process-configuration contract and thin CLI/MCP adapters for PM_CLOCK, PM_CLOCK_TICK_MS, and PM_SEED without changing default wall-clock behavior."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-22T12:29:57.227Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-22T13:41:55.511Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-22T13:31:17.146Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-22T13:31:17.146Z"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: "PM_CLOCK plus PM_SEED opts CLI, embedded CLI, and MCP process dispatch into the SDK deterministic context; PM_CLOCK_TICK_MS is optional and validated as a non-negative integer; partial or invalid configuration fails with a stable typed error and executable recovery; identical process sequences in fresh workspaces produce byte-identical identifiers, timestamps, and history; no variables preserves current wall-clock and random-entropy behavior; the public SDK owns parsing, validation, constants, types, and execution"
goal: project management = context management
objective: Make deterministic workspace execution reachable from every supported process transport without global monkey-patching
value: "Conformance, golden-file, replay, and cross-language harnesses can compare authoritative pm bytes through supported interfaces"
why_now: GitHub issue 1089 demonstrates that the closed SDK recipe feature leaves binary consumers on the original nondeterministic path
parent: pm-usfg
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "Implemented the published SDK process-environment contract and thin bundled CLI/MCP adapters, preserving default nondeterminism and providing typed recovery for invalid opt-in."
expected_result: "Published SDK configuration installs deterministic execution in CLI and MCP without affecting the unset default, and invalid input fails before dispatch with executable typed recovery."
actual_result: "SDK exports, bundled CLI, direct and long-lived MCP adapters, generated contracts, operator docs, and exact transport coverage implement the full expected boundary."
